%% From invoice to reconciled bank deposit (card payments; bank transfers follow the
%% same recording and reconciliation path without the processor).
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant SB as SolidBooks
  participant C as Customer
  participant P as Payment processor
  participant B as Bank feed

  opt Recurring billing with automatic payment
    SB->>C: Billing link with the authorization terms
    C->>P: Saves a card (authorization recorded)
  end
  SB->>C: Invoice email with a private View & Pay link
  C->>SB: Opens the invoice and payment page
  alt Customer pays by card
    C->>P: Pays on the processor's secure form
  else Automatic payment is authorized
    SB->>P: Charges the saved card for this invoice only
  end
  P-->>SB: Signed webhook
  Note over SB: Verify signature · store event once by id ·<br/>re-fetch amounts from the processor
  SB->>SB: Post payment and processing fee (balanced entry)
  SB->>C: Receipt
  P-->>B: Payout to the business bank account
  B-->>SB: Bank transaction (daily sync)
  SB->>SB: Match payout to the recorded payments (reconciled)
